  "status": "Delivered area abilities and themed menus preview. Package and Drive metadata checks pass; physical Android acceptance remains open.",
  "changes": [
    "Bakery Jam Burst fills every fifth normal doughnut; its first hit splashes up to two nearby pegs through the shared coin budget.",
    "Each area offers its signature ability through the tray-8 earned route or an optional permanent early-access test purchase. No real Play payment is connected.",
    "Three native themed frames style Settings, Pause and ability offers; a native jam doughnut and charge/splash feedback support Bakery gameplay.",
    "New campaign runs use Flow rules2 from tray8: stronger pegs and independently increased damage/break/clear rewards. Prior active runs retain their original rules; Trials remain fixed.",
    "Existing earned abilities and Gelato Power-reset history are preserved, including saves when a preview entitlement becomes unavailable."
  ],
